Bundled components and notices
-----------------------------

* pdf-lib 1.17.1: MIT for pdf-lib itself (vendor/pdf-lib/LICENSE.md).
  The ESM bundle also contains tslib (Apache-2.0), Pako (MIT and Zlib),
  @pdf-lib/upng (MIT) and @pdf-lib/standard-fonts (MIT for its code), with
  Base64 ArrayBuffer (MIT), PDFKit path code (MIT) and the Apache-licensed
  PDF.js/Xpdf Flate port. Core 14 Adobe font metrics carry separate Adobe
  conditions, including notice retention and marking modifications. The Adobe
  notice is retained here; treatment of the converted data and exact upstream
  ancestry are open release questions. The bundle is not MIT-only.
* PDF.js/pdfjs-dist 6.5.438: Apache-2.0 for PDF.js code (vendor/pdfjs/LICENSE).
  Both JS bundles retain Mozilla's inline notice. The reference source maps
  also attribute MurmurHash to Opera (Apache-2.0); the worker has the Xpdf Flate
  attribution, embeds Google's Brotli decoder (MIT) and uses Mozilla wrappers
  for qcms (MIT), JBIG2 (Apache-2.0 with PDFium notices), and OpenJPEG
  (BSD-2-Clause). The same decoder families have separate assets below.
* Packed Adobe CMaps: BSD-3-Clause terms (vendor/pdfjs/cmaps/LICENSE).
* Foxit standard fonts: PDFium BSD-3-Clause terms and Foxit attribution
  (vendor/pdfjs/standard_fonts/LICENSE_FOXIT and docs/licenses/attributions.txt).
* Compact ICC profile: CC0-1.0 (vendor/pdfjs/iccs/LICENSE); this is the actual
  upstream designation, not Apache-2.0 or a project policy determination.
* JBIG2 WASM and fallback: PDFium BSD-3-Clause and Apache-2.0 notices plus
  Mozilla Apache-2.0 wrapper notice. See LICENSE_JBIG2 and LICENSE_PDFJS_JBIG2
  in vendor/pdfjs/wasm/ (full Apache terms also in vendor/pdfjs/LICENSE).
* OpenJPEG WASM and fallback: BSD-2-Clause, upstream and Mozilla notices
  (LICENSE_OPENJPEG and LICENSE_PDFJS_OPENJPEG in vendor/pdfjs/wasm/).
* qcms WASM: MIT, upstream and Mozilla notices (LICENSE_QCMS and
  LICENSE_PDFJS_QCMS in vendor/pdfjs/wasm/).
* QuickJS sandbox JS and WASM: MIT, upstream and Mozilla notices
  (LICENSE_QUICKJS and LICENSE_PDFJS_QUICKJS in vendor/pdfjs/wasm/).

Exact official npm distributions:
  https://registry.npmjs.org/pdf-lib/-/pdf-lib-1.17.1.tgz
